      "Describe the reviewer method before the domain-specific result.",
      "Call out observation, comment, possible finding, and confirmed finding separately.",
      "State why confidence changed and whether an exception applied.",
      "Mention missing context explicitly when the answer is not final.",
      "If meaning is indirect, say whether it is recovered through subtext, metaphor, symbolism, or later dialogue."
